# Android build output and local machine state.
#
# The repository root's .gitignore ignores Electron's own output directories
# (out/, dist/, release/) but has no generic `build/` pattern — checked, not
# assumed, since AGP's default output is exactly `build/` at three depths here
# (android/build/, android/app/build/, android/buildSrc/build/). So `build/`
# is named explicitly below rather than relied on from the root file. Kept
# here rather than merged into the root file so the AF1 diff stays inside
# /android.
#
# The two keystore lines are the load-bearing ones (AF1.md §2.2): AF10 has the
# maker generating tritium.jks locally, and losing control of it means losing
# the ability to update the app for every existing user. They are in place
# from the first commit, before any keystore exists.

build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
local.properties

# Signing material. Never committed, under any circumstances.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties

# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
captures/

# Build artefacts and native intermediates
*.apk
*.aab
*.hprof
.cxx/
